  "playingConnection": "After supported reading, choose a comfortable pulse with a teacher or partner. Speak a bar, then clap or play it while someone else keeps the beat. Keep a quarter note sounding or moving for the whole beat; divide paired eighths evenly. Repeat across a barline, then try a different bar. Observe pulse, even halves, duration and continuity separately from the app score. These skills need live observation; choosing a count on screen does not demonstrate them. Add a silent span or a long note, then change its placement in a new paper bar. Observe elapsed pulse, silent duration, held duration and next attack separately. Use the free kit/lesson for a later check; app accuracy is not validated mastery.",
