      "beforeLegacyStep": 4,
      "lesson": "In 4/4, follow four quarter-note beats. A quarter starts on the number; paired eighths start on the number and &. An eighth note followed by an eighth rest starts only on the number; an eighth rest followed by an eighth note starts only on &. Both rests still occupy time. Here & alone can be correct. Choices describe written note starts, not duration; | separates nonempty groups of starts. A quarter and an eighth followed by a rest share a count, so this app cannot tell whether you distinguished their durations. No e or a responses are used in this repair.",
