      "beforeLegacyStep": 7,
      "lesson": "This one-beat fragment starts on beat 1. Divide that beat into four equal positions: 1 e & a. A sixteenth note occupies one position; an eighth note or rest occupies two. Two sixteenth notes then an eighth rest count 1 e. An eighth rest then two sixteenth notes count & a. A sixteenth rest then three sixteenth notes count e & a. Silent positions still take time. Wrong choices may add, omit or move a start, or use 2 as a wrong beat number; 2 is not a second beat in this fragment. Read choices as note starts, not the duration of a sound.",
